- this library is not available from public Maven repositories: it is republished
  here unmodified, under the org.gov4j.thirdparty.* namespaces
- no patch is applied and there is nothing to rebuild: the published jar differs from
  the original only by the META-INF/maven entries that packaging adds
- this directory holds only the pom.xml used to publish it; the artifacts themselves
  are available from Maven Central:
    https://central.sonatype.com/artifact/org.gov4j.thirdparty.org.tp23.antinstaller/ai-icons-eclipse_antinstaller/0.8b
    https://central.sonatype.com/artifact/org.gov4j.thirdparty.org.tp23.antinstaller/ant-installer/0.8b
    https://central.sonatype.com/artifact/org.gov4j.thirdparty.org.tp23.antinstaller/jgoodies-edited/1.2.2
    https://central.sonatype.com/artifact/org.gov4j.thirdparty.org.tp23.antinstaller/xml-apis_antinstaller/0.8b
